A second vendor also solved `medium`; this confirms the 27-dimensional instance with small coefficients is not enough. The next named rung keeps the same matrix size but makes the exact rational witness denser and substantially increases numerator/denominator ambiguity.
diff --git a/gen_1702_02885.py b/gen_1702_02885.py
